  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "苦味が　強い　食材。独特のクセが　特徴の野菜。やや好みが　分かれる　食材だ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓴맛이 강한 식재료. 독특한 향이 특징적인 채소로, 호불호가 은근히 갈린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味強勁的食材。以獨特滋味為特徵的蔬菜。人們對其的好惡略有區隔。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très amer. Ce légume au goût vraiment unique laisse rarement indifférent : soit on l’aime, soit on le déteste.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Durch ihren eigentümlichen Geschmack hebt sich diese sehr bittere Zutat von anderen Gemüsen ab. Von einigen heiß geliebt, kommt sie anderen niemals aufs Brot.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una verdura que, debido a su fuerte sabor amargo y a su aroma algo peculiar, suele provocar reacciones muy diferentes según quien la coma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto amaro. Il particolare sapore che contraddistingue questa verdura divide un po’ gli animi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very bitter ingredient that stands out among veggies for its quirky flavor. People tend to either like it or not like it—they rarely sit on the fence.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味が　強い　食材。独特のクセが　特徴の野菜。やや好みが　分かれる　食材だ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
